{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">&amp;SCOPED-DEFINE preprocessor directive</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/308864","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">&amp;SCOPED-DEFINE preprocessor\ndirective</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Defines a compile-time constant (preprocessor\nname) non-globally.</p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive__syntax_GC151J2678915\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d76173e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive__idGDE1UK2661634\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>&amp;SCOPED-DEFINE <var class=\"keyword varname\">preprocessor-name definition</var></code></pre>\n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">preprocessor-name</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">The preprocessor name (compile-time constant) that you supply. ABL\nreserved keywords are allowed, but cannot be used in preprocessor expressions. </dd>\n        \n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">definition</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">A string of characters (or preprocessor references that evaluate to a\n            string of characters) whose content the preprocessor substitutes for <var class=\"keyword varname\">preprocessor-name</var> during compilation. If definition is\n            longer than on line, a tilde (<code class=\"ph codeph\">~</code>) at the end of a line indicates\n            continuation to the next line.</dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive__notes_GC151K2678924\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d76173e157\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">You must place the <code class=\"ph codeph\">&amp;SCOPED-DEFINE</code> directive at the\n          beginning of a line, preceded only by blanks, tab characters, or comments (<code class=\"ph codeph\">/* </code><var class=\"keyword varname\">comment</var><code class=\"ph codeph\"> */</code>). The preprocessor trims all leading and trailing spaces\n          from <var class=\"keyword varname\">definition</var>.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">The syntax of the <code class=\"ph codeph\">&amp;GLOBAL-DEFINE</code> and\n            <code class=\"ph codeph\">&amp;SCOPED-DEFINE</code> directives are identical but these directives are\n          used differently. </li>\n        <li class=\"li\">The compiler removes <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Multi-line-comments.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Multi-line-comments.html\">/* Multi-line comments */</a> on lines of ABL code with\n          preprocessor directives. To retain comments, use <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Single-line-comments.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Single-line-comments.html\">// Single-line comments</a> or\n          escape the multi-line comment using a <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Special-character.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Special-character.html\">tilde\n              (<code class=\"ph codeph\">~</code>)</a>. For example, <code class=\"ph codeph\">&amp;SCOPED-DEFINE VAR3 DEF VAR xpos\n            AS INT. /~* column position of fill-in *~/</code>.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive__see-also_GC151L2678931\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d76173e212\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"Preprocessor-name-reference.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/Preprocessor-name-reference.html\">{ } Preprocessor name reference</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ampGLOBAL-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ampGLOBAL-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\">&amp;GLOBAL-DEFINE preprocessor directive</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ampUNDEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ampUNDEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\">&amp;UNDEFINE preprocessor directive</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"DEFINED-preprocessor-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/DEFINED-preprocessor-function.html\">DEFINED preprocessor function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ampMESSAGE-preprocessor-directive.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ampMESSAGE-preprocessor-directive.html\">&amp;MESSAGE preprocessor directive</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"ampUNDEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ampUNDEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html\">&amp;UNDEFINE preprocessor directive</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/308864","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":576,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"&SCOPED-DEFINE preprocessor directive","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ampSCOPED-DEFINE-preprocessor-directive.html","type":"Manual"}